      "id": "2120234542178983955",
      "text": "This is the political platform I’d like to see adopted…\n\n“The best defence a nation can build isn’t just miltary hardware. It's becoming an an example.”\n\nStrive to be the ‘shining city on the hill’:\n\n• Abundant, low-cost, clean energy, because cheap power lifts everything else\n\n• Modern infrastructure and agriculture that feed its people and have plenty left to share\n\n• World-class education, the best health care, low crime and the lowest unemployment\n\n• A culture of sharing and harmony at home, so prosperity reaches everyone\n\nThen turn it outward. Be the nation that shows up first with aid, power, food and know-how when others are struggling.\n\nThe surest way to end terrorism is to run out of enemies. Make as many friends as possible. Give people hope and a model worth copying, and extremism loses its recruits.\n\nEnergy is where it starts. Every leap in living standards in history has been an energy story. The nation that gets cheap, clean energy right gets to lead by example.\n\nDon't tell the world how to do it. Show them.",
